{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/wordo_ei.png?t=1745260861\" /><strong>\u3010New\u3011What have we been up to since we last met?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you to everyone who participated in the last Next Fest! Based on your feedback, we\u2019ve made the following improvements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Smoother difficulty curve</strong>: We've restructured the level order to make it easier for newcomers to get started, while offering veteran players a fresh challenge rhythm!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Non-linear levels with free exploration</strong>: A brand-new level selection interface that maintains a clear structure while allowing free jumps between levels to revisit your favorites.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope these optimizations bring you a smoother puzzle-solving experience if you're a fan of Sokoban games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, the real surprise will be in the upcoming full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/wordo_uwu.png?t=1745260861\" /><strong>\u3010New\u3011What\u2019s coming in the full version? A sneak peek!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full version, we\u2019re bringing even more brain-teasing concepts to \u201ctext-based Sokoban\u201d:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*To preserve the ultimate experience of the full version, the following mechanics will not be included in the demo.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Box transformations:\u00a0</strong><i>Anything can transform</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Little critters:\u00a0</strong><i>Their uniqueness isn\u2019t just in their appearance, but also in how they can be combined</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recognition and splitting:\u00a0</strong><i>Hello, you've been chosen, come out for a bit</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Countdown farewell:\u00a0</strong><i>Like life, some things gradually disappear and cannot be saved</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Add Wordban to your wishlist now and witness Wordo's full evolution!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010About this game\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/wordo_normal.png?t=1745260861\" />Hi there! <strong>Wordban</strong>'s free demo is ready! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wordban</strong> is a text-based Sokoban-style game where you control the adorable <strong>Wordo</strong> to push boxes and trigger each level's innovative text rules, changing the layout, quantity, and even the attributes of the boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/description_gameplay.gif?t=1745260861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/wordo_ei.png?t=1745260861\" />With your strategy, <strong>Wordo</strong> can make boxes multiply, merge into one, drip through stone, or even turn into gold! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the <strong>Wordban Demo</strong>, you can enjoy a free preview of the game's 1st chapter: <strong>The Room</strong>, featuring 20 unique levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/description_chapter1.gif?t=1745260861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/wordo_uwu.png?t=1745260861\" />Awaken <strong>Wordo</strong> and enjoy the special puzzle-solving fun!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wake Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3202180/0431d08a01942b5c8d3b9ab80bba9af20db5a2fb.jpg"},{"name":"Found the Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3202180/48a8daef4edb85d88fca97f7711c024cb2e20ffd.jpg"},{"name":"Room Patrol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3202180/1c574b7574e4e9b86f7d4573cde2955224dd4d22.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3202180?t=1745260861","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745260861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/397f0c8a103c76a1d94b36fa357a2c242044303f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745260861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/397f0c8a103c76a1d94b36fa357a2c242044303f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745260861","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"desc