ot be included in the demo.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Box transformations:\u00a0</strong><i>Anything can transform</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Little critters:\u00a0</strong><i>Their uniqueness isn\u2019t just in their appearance, but also in how they can be combined</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recognition and splitting:\u00a0</strong><i>Hello, you've been chosen, come out for a bit</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Countdown farewell:\u00a0</strong><i>Like life, some things gradually disappear and cannot be saved</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Add Wordban to your wishlist now and witness Wordo's full evolution!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010About this game\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/wordo_normal.png?t=1745260861\" />Hi there! <strong>Wordban</strong>'s free demo is ready! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wordban</strong> is a text-based Sokoban-style game where you control the adorable <strong>Wordo</strong> to push boxes and trigger each level's innovative text rules, changing the layout, quantity, and even the attributes of the boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/description_gameplay.gif?t=1745260861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/wordo_ei.png?t=1745260861\" />With your strategy, <strong>Wordo</strong> can make boxes multiply, merge into one, drip through stone, or even turn into gold! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the <strong>Wordban Demo</strong>, you can enjoy a free preview of the game's 1st chapter: <strong>The Room</strong>, featuring 20 unique levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/description_chapter1.gif?t=1745260861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/extras/wordo_uwu.png?t=1745260861\" />Awaken <strong>Wordo</strong> and enjoy the special puzzle-solving fun!</p>","developers":["Beibi Technology Co., Ltd."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3126790","name":"Wordban: a text-based Sokoban game"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202180/header.jpg?t=1745260861","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz+, 32- or 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> ATI Radeon X1300/NVIDIA GeForce 6600 GT/Intel HD 3000 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Intel High Definition Audio</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Snow Leopard 10.6